        <mxCell id="lUXanKGTzzZB3nufodFp-69" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; face=&quot;Georgia&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-12dc698e-7fff-c57e-bea4-16c277597bd2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Dynamic educator with 3 years of comprehensive experience in teaching and social service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(122, 122, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;dedicated to fostering an engaging learning environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Expertise in geography and teaching methodologies enhances the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(51, 51, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;ability to effectively communicate complex concepts and inspire students&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(207, 207, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(51, 51, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Proven skills in classroom management and adaptability promote a positive educational experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(51, 51, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;equipping learners with essential knowledge and critical thinking abilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(51, 51, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(51, 51, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Committed to lifelong learning and community &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(51, 51, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;involvement, continuously striving to impact students and society positively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(207, 207, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;strokeWidth=0;opacity=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="270" y="290" width="1030" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lUXanKGTzzZB3nufodFp-57" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Income-qualification (Inter-American Development Bank)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Worked with huge dataset of 9500 datapoints with 141 features. It&#39;s a multiclass classification Problem. As part of these project&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;primary idenfication was to identify the target variable. Understand the type of the data and if there any bias. Check the poverty&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;level of houses and depending on them classify the income group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 18px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 18px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Mercedes-Benz-Greener- Fuel Emission Prediction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Worked with huge dataset with 385 features. Performed exploratory data analysis on the dataset. Removed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt; column with&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; zero&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;variance, applied label encoder for categorical features. Dimentionality reduction using covariance matrix, eigen values, PCA,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Wrapper method, fiter method etc. At the end concluded the project using ensemble learning for regression&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="272" y="1518" width="922" height="252" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
